# nl-config-3: tests only; one module line is needed in a file this task does not own.

## 1. native/core/crates/mixdog-core-config/src/workflow/mod.rs
After the existing
    #[cfg(test)]
    mod tests;
add
    #[cfg(test)]
    #[path = "../routes/tests.rs"]
    mod web_search_refusal_tests;
(the file is native/core/crates/mixdog-core-config/src/routes/tests.rs; it tests `search::plan` through the private `search` module, so it hangs under `workflow`.)

## 2. mixdog-core-agents store_migration.rs: nothing to wire (its tests are in the file's own `mod tests`).
